    {
      "title": "Script Registry Hit Rate",
      "description": "In-memory compiled script cache hit ratio. Higher is better -- hits avoid recompilation. A low hit rate means scripts are being evicted frequently; consider increasing the registry size or checking for excessive script variations.",
